# Applies to every image built with the REPO ROOT as context
# (deploy/observer-edge, Dockerfile.observer-org, deploy/observer-gateway).
# Those are all pure-Go builds; every go:embed asset lives under internal/
# (the dashboards embed internal/*/webapp/dist, not web//web2/ directly), so
# the web sources, distribution channels, and the private marketing/site
# trees are dead weight in the build context (~20 GB without this file).
# harness-gateway builds from its OWN directory context and is unaffected.

.git
.wrangler
bin
tmp
marketing
harness-gateway
model-pricing
website
design
web
web2
vscode
sdk
npm
pypi
docs
# docs/embed.go embeds the eight deployment runbooks into observer-org
# (`observer-org deploy export`); the root-level markdown must stay in the
# context or the go:embed pattern fails the image build. Only docs/*.md is
# re-included (180 files / 5.6 MB) plus the embed declaration itself;
# docs/ subdirectories stay excluded.
!docs/*.md
!docs/embed.go
browser-extension
observer
observer.exe
*.log
node_modules
**/node_modules
